{"parentUuid":"64192988-a9a8-4bdb-8df3-64656a05cd6b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CefqD97dJE4XsfAj13UYF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CBbCXQFjHU1RJv4ybWvfaH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfr = \"\"\"Au sud de la péninsule d'Izu, Shimoda est une ville charmante à l'histoire lourde. C'est le premier port que le Japon a ouvert à l'Occident, en 1854, sous la menace des canons du Commodore Perry. Le traité s'est signé à Kanagawa, mais c'est ici, au temple Ryosen-ji, qu'on en a fixé les modalités, et ici que le premier consul américain s'est installé. La fin du sakoku, la fermeture du pays pendant la période Edo.\n\nPerry Road est la rue qu'il a remontée avec ses hommes. Des murs blancs quadrillés, des entrepôts de pierre, une rivière. La balade y est très agréable.\n\nUn peu plus au nord, la plage de Shirahama et son sanctuaire, le plus ancien d'Izu. Le torii rouge est posé sur un rocher, face à la mer.\"\"\"\n\nen = \"\"\"At the southern tip of the Izu peninsula, Shimoda is a charming town with a heavy history. It is the first port Japan opened to the West, in 1854, under the guns of Commodore Perry. The treaty was signed in Kanagawa, but the terms were settled here, at Ryosen-ji temple, and the first American consul settled here too. The end of sakoku, the closing of the country during the Edo period.\n\nPerry Road is the street he walked up with his men. White latticed walls, stone warehouses, a river. It is a beautiful walk.\n\nA little further north, Shirahama beach and its shrine, the oldest in Izu. The red torii stands on a rock, facing the sea.\"\"\"\n\njp = \"\"\"伊豆半島の南端、下田。穏やかな町だが、背負っている歴史は重い。1854年、ペリーの砲艦を前に、日本が西洋へ最初に開いた港である。条約そのものは神奈川で結ばれたが、その細目が決まったのはここ、了仙寺だった。初代アメリカ総領事が住んだのもこの町。江戸の鎖国が終わる。\n\nペリーロードは、彼が部下を連れて歩いた道。なまこ壁、石造りの蔵、川沿いの静けさ。歩くだけで気持ちがいい。\n\n少し北へ行けば白浜。伊豆で最も古い神社が建ち、赤い鳥居が岩の上から海を向いている。\"\"\"\n\ntags = \"#下田 #shimoda #izu #perryroad #japan_photo_now\"\nleg = \"🇬🇧 EN/🇯🇵 日本語/🇫🇷 FR\\n\\n\" + en + \"\\n\\n---\\n\\n\" + jp + \"\\n\\n---\\n\\n\" + fr + \"\\n\\n\" + tags\nfor n,b in ((\"EN\",en),(\"JP\",jp),(\"FR\",fr)): print(f\"{n:3} {len(b):4}\")\nprint(\"TOTAL\", len(leg), \"/ 2200 plafond, 2000 cible\")\nassert \"—\" not in leg and \"–\" not in leg, \"tiret long\"\nprint(\"tirets longs: aucun · hashtags:\", leg.count(\"#\"))\nopen(\"/tmp/shimoda.txt\",\"w\").write(leg)\nPY","description":"Écrire et mesurer le post Shimoda"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2196,"cache_read_input_tokens":446074,"output_tokens":1156,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2196,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1156,"cache_read_input_tokens":446074,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2196},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CefqD7KyE5vEzBymTmPXg","attributionSkill":"zenray-html-photoshop-pdf-hda","attributionMcpServer":"Claude Browser","attributionMcpTool":"tabs_close","type":"assistant","uuid":"50e890b4-7e56-4ab1-9984-601ebfa71888","timestamp":"2026-09-03T03:56:01.025Z","effort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/zenray/Create/Build/Memory","sessionId":"d1625f5d-ead7-46dd-82ce-0fd32749d6a9","version":"2.1.258","gitBranch":"main","slug":"wise-riding-orbit"}
